# Icons and favicons

## Favicon

- Primary file: `public/favicon.svg` (linked from `BaseLayout.astro`)
- Brand mark: horizontal `DN` (single `<text>`, same row) on a rounded square
- Dark theme: charcoal square `#111318` with cyan letters `#22D3EE` (matches `--color-bg` / `--color-accent`)
- Light theme (if restored): accent-filled square with white `DN`
- 64×64 viewBox, `rx="12"`, Inter 800, flat — no gradients, shadows, or stroke
- Prefer SVG; do not rely on `favicon.png` unless regenerating for legacy clients

## New icons

- Prefer SVG over PNG; place assets under `public/`
- Flat, geometric, readable at 16–32px
- Use Inter for lettermarks; keep letterforms horizontal unless explicitly requested otherwise
- Avoid decorative glow, multi-layer shadows, and emoji-as-icons
- When the theme accent changes, update icon fills that use the brand color to match `--color-accent`
